2. **Apply it in your CSS:**
   ```css
   body {
       font-family: 'SF Pro Display', sans-serif;
   }
   ```

---

### Option 2: Custom `@font-face` using jsDelivr / NPM CDN
If you prefer managing specific weights via `@font-face` using a reliable open-source CDN like jsDelivr, you can link directly to packages containing standard web fonts[1]:

```css
